{
  "schema": 1,
  "id": "shah-optimized-features-20261110-r001",
  "description": "E231 predeclared features sweep, three fresh runtimes per arm, fixed compile/input; buffered with selected per-chunk controls. Host stream windows, not PE or GCN latency. No automatic retry; failure and actual I/O mapping retained.",
  "steps": [
